# ===== .dockerignore =====
# Place this file in the strata-cloud/ root (same level as the Dockerfiles).
# It controls what Docker includes in the build context.

# Virtual environments
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Test artifacts
**/tests
**/test-results
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/.pytest_cache

# Dev/IDE
**/.git
**/.claude
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# Env files (secrets injected at runtime, NEVER baked in)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docker files themselves
**/docker-compose.yml
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore

# Documentation (not needed in runtime image)
**/*.md
**/docs

# API client collections
**/bruno

# Infrastructure code
**/infra
**/terraform

# Egg info
**/*.egg-info
